{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:41:43.888Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c01dfeae359d0fd60c4ca784558e8c245c641ee92c055e9cc66014b38117e277","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, here is what the channel history and Moss's Coastal notes show on your three points.\n\n1. **Takeover:** Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh Provisions changes hands on Monday, Oct 6, 2025. The note doesn't name who took it over. Later notes and channel messages refer to it as \"Bettina's grocery account\" and \"Sofia's old grocery account\", so it points to Bettina Kroll. I'd confirm that with her before it goes in the handover file.\n\n2. **Discount:** It stands at 10%. On Nov 17, 2025 Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it within minutes. She had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet, and the corrected figure is 10%.\n\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827. Kwame opened it on Oct 15, 2025, after Corinne lost her admin rights. PD-4824 is a different ticket, about the reefer door-move exceptions, so don't use it for the access issue."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
